# Privacy Policy for Fibonacci for Binance

**Last updated: September 24, 2026**

Fibonacci for Binance ("the App") respects your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how information is handled when you use the App.

## 1. Information We Collect

Fibonacci for Binance does not directly collect, store, or share personal information.

The App does not require you to create an account or provide personal information such as your name, email address, phone number, or physical address.

## 2. Financial and Cryptocurrency Information

The App may retrieve publicly available cryptocurrency market data from third-party services, including Binance, in order to provide its features.

The App does not provide financial, investment, or trading advice. Information displayed by the App is provided for informational purposes only.

## 3. API Keys

The App does not require users to provide Binance API keys, secret keys, passwords, or other account credentials.

## 4. Third-Party Services

The App may communicate with third-party services to retrieve publicly available market data.

These third-party services may have their own privacy policies and terms of service. Users should review the privacy policies of the relevant third-party services.

## 5. Data Storage

The App does not maintain a personal database or server for storing users' personal information.

## 6. Data Sharing

We do not sell, rent, or share users' personal information with third parties.

## 7. Children's Privacy

The App is not specifically directed toward children. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children.

## 8. Security

Although the App does not collect personal information, reasonable measures are taken to ensure that the App operates securely.

## 9. Changes to This Privacy Policy

This Privacy Policy may be updated from time to time. Any changes will be reflected on this page with an updated "Last updated" date.

## 10. Contact

If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, you may contact the developer through the contact information provided on the App's Google Play Store listing.

